{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/46f409d80b16b2d8694cff8ab8fcfbae.avif?t=1755461976\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tormentis</strong> is an action RPG that combines fast, loot-driven combat with the strategic construction of your own castle.<br><br>Build deadly defenses filled with traps, guardians, and clever room structures \u2013 and raid the castles of other players to claim valuable loot and secure your place in the seasonal leaderboard.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/f498d37eaf5ac0d0d129c720b0dffc89.avif?t=1755461976\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own castle with individually placeable rooms, enemies, and traps. Strengthen your defenses to bring attackers to their knees \u2013 and secure resources and rewards in the process.<br><br>But be warned: your castle never rests. Other players will attempt to break through your defenses and steal your treasures. Only those who build cleverly, place strategically, and use their resources wisely will prevail as rulers of their castle.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/b13cb32e8cf70773502dd8617bf602f1.avif?t=1755461976\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour other players\u2019 castles in action-packed battles from an isometric perspective. Dodge deadly traps, defeat their defenders, and claim their most valuable treasures.<br><br>With quick reflexes, smart tactics, and the right gear, you will survive your opponents\u2019 defenses. Those who master the dangers will seize valuable resources and rare materials to continuously improve their equipment.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/b11340ec235c75b73f4e383f7f509082.avif?t=1755461976\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunder high-quality gear, enhance it with targeted use of resources and a touch of luck. Use the auction house or trade directly with other players to create your ideal build.<br><br>Experiment with different combinations of weapons, armor, and skills to perfect your playstyle. Every decision brings you closer to your ultimate build!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/1382ba0d4097cc36622667b3bf4b5d5c.avif?t=1755461976\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful raid earns you trophies that improve your rank in the league. At the end of the season, exclusive rewards await the most successful players \u2013 defend your position or strike back!<br><br>Climb the ranks to compete with the best players. Each season brings new opportunities to place your name at the top of the league \u2013 and leave your rivals in awe of your castle and your strength.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782480/extras/9c5c2448b7f5de1fb91f5858b60205fe.avif?t=1755461976\" width=1260 height=160 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Castle building with strategic depth</li><li>Action-packed battles in classic ARPG style</li><li>A wide variety of traps, monsters, and rooms</li><li>Loot system with legendary items</li><li>Item trading via auction house and direct exchange</li><li>Seasonal leaderboard with exclusive rewards</li><li>Adventure Mode to create countless castles and share them with other players</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shattered Valley Conquerer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co